member.summary:
Wallpaper configuration for Windows Spotlight mode.
Windows Spotlight manages its own image downloads and selection;
this config only controls which of the currently available images to activate.

Extracts the stable  and 
from a Windows PnP monitor device path.

Example path:  \\?\DISPLAY#DELA0D6#5&2a50fee&0&UID257#{e6f07b5f-...}
Segments (split on '#'):  [0] \\?\DISPLAY  [1] DELA0D6  [2] 5&2a50fee&0&UID257  [3] {GUID}

hardwareId   = segment[1]  e.g. "DELA0D6"  — monitor model; stable unless monitor is swapped.
connectorId  = the token in segment[2] that starts with "UID"  e.g. "UID257" — GPU port;
               stable unless the cable is physically moved to a different port.
